#: windowsrunner.cpp:36
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finds windows whose name, window class or window role match :q:. It is "
"possible to interact with the windows by using one of the following "
"keywords: activate, close, min(imize), max(imize), fullscreen, shade, keep "
"above and keep below."
msgstr "विंडो अथवा विंडो अछि मे क' सँग सँ क' अनुसरण कए रहल अछि बन्न करू min उप्पर आओर नीच्चाँ."

#: windowsrunner.cpp:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Finds windows which are on desktop named :q: It is possible to interact with "
"the windows by using one of the following keywords: activate, close, min"
"(imize), max(imize), fullscreen, shade, keep above and keep below."
msgstr "पर अछि मे क' सँग सँ क' अनुसरण कए रहल अछि बन्न करू min उप्पर आओर नीच्चाँ."

